  "Black carbon steel round pipe (Self Color) supplied by Tianjin Decent International Trade Co., Ltd. is produced from premium hot-rolled carbon steel strip formed into high-integrity cylindrical pipe with bare mill finish (Self Color) or protective light oiling.\n\nEngineered for exceptional mechanical strength, superior weldability, and versatile fabrication for low-pressure fluid conveyance, gas, heating, mechanical structures, and general engineering. Available in standard lengths of 5.8 m, 6.0 m, 11.8 m, and 12.0 m with plain ends, beveled ends, threaded & coupled, or roll grooved.": "Black carbon steel round pipe (Self Color) supplied by Tianjin Decent International Trade Co., Ltd. is produced from premium hot-rolled carbon steel strip formed into high-integrity cylindrical pipe with bare mill finish (Self Color) or protective light oiling.\n\nEngineered for exceptional mechanical strength, superior weldability, and versatile fabrication for low-pressure fluid conveyance, gas, heating, mechanical structures, and general engineering. Available in standard lengths of 5.8 m, 6.0 m, 11.8 m, and 12.0 m with plain ends, beveled ends, threaded & coupled, or roll grooved.",
