  "Tube & Fitting scaffolding is a versatile traditional modular scaffolding system consisting of high-strength steel tubes connected using mechanical couplers and clamps. It is suitable for construction, maintenance, access, and temporary support works where site conditions demand complete dimensional freedom.\n\nBecause couplers can be fastened at any position along the 48.3 mm diameter tubes, this system can wrap around irregular building profiles, accommodate uneven terrain, bridge complex obstacles, and adapt where prefabricated modular systems are constrained. Supplied with hot-dip galvanized or painted finish with drop-forged EN 74 compliant couplers.": "Tube & Fitting scaffolding is a versatile traditional modular scaffolding system consisting of high-strength steel tubes connected using mechanical couplers and clamps. It is suitable for construction, maintenance, access, and temporary support works where site conditions demand complete dimensional freedom.\n\nBecause couplers can be fastened at any position along the 48.3 mm diameter tubes, this system can wrap around irregular building profiles, accommodate uneven terrain, bridge complex obstacles, and adapt where prefabricated modular systems are constrained. Supplied with hot-dip galvanized or painted finish with drop-forged EN 74 compliant couplers.",
